# Rock Racketeer (windurst 26): Ardea's lines next to Chasing Quotas' (the reply kinds). A level-10 WAR in Bastok
# Markets, Rock Racketeer accepted by GM, Chasing Quotas accepted by GM at Prog 4: its 265 (an Event, no finish handler)
# answers at Ardea on every talk. Prog 0: 261 (Progress) over 265 on both talks (option 2: nothing, Prog 0 kept).
# Prog 1 (GM): 262 and 265 tie (Events) and take turns; Prog 2 (GM): 263 and 265 take turns.
lists BastokMarkets/Ardea/onTrigger
char zone=BastokMarkets pos=-196,-6,-69 job=WAR lvl=10
quest Windurst.MihgosAmigo completed
quest Windurst.RockRacketeer accepted
quest Sandoria.ChasingQuotas accepted
charvar Quest[0][95]Prog 4
login
trigger Ardea                                  # Prog 0: 261 (Progress) over 265
finish option=2                                # nothing
trigger Ardea                                  # 261 again
finish option=2
charvar Quest[2][26]Prog 1                     # GM
trigger Ardea                                  # Prog 1: 262 and 265 tie: one of them
finish
trigger Ardea                                  # the other
finish
charvar Quest[2][26]Prog 2                     # GM
trigger Ardea                                  # Prog 2: 263 and 265 tie: one of them
finish
trigger Ardea                                  # the other
finish
